#: js/bioland-help-comments-1-0-21.js
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Taimako"

#: js/bioland-help-comments-1-0-21.js
msgid "This will be the main content of your new site content.  The summary can be used to display a brief concise description of your content.  Further, the summary  will be displayed in list and card views of your record on the website.  Alternatively, the first few sentence from the main content will be used."
msgstr "Wannan zai zama babban abun cikin sabon abun cikin shafinku. Ana iya amfani da takaitawa don nuna taƙaitaccen bayanin abun cikin ku. Bugu da ƙari, za a nuna takaitawar a cikin jerin gwano da kallon kati na rikodin ku a kan gidan yanar gizon. A madadin haka, za a yi amfani da 'yan jimlolin farko daga babban abun ciki."

#: js/bioland-help-comments-1-0-21.js
msgid "Images"
msgstr "Hotuna"

#: js/bioland-help-comments-1-0-21.js
msgid "The <b>first image</b> in order of left to right here, <b>will be the main image</b> of your record displayed on the page and in thumbnails in list and card views.  All another images will be displayed below the main content."
msgstr "<b>Hoto na farko</b> a cikin jerin daga hagu zuwa dama a nan, <b>zai zama babban hoton</b> rikodin ku da aka nuna a shafin da kuma a cikin ƙananan hotuna a cikin jerin gwano da kallon kati. Duk sauran hotuna za a nuna su a ƙasan babban abun ciki."

#: js/bioland-help-comments-1-0-21.js
msgid "Heroes"
msgstr "Jaruman Hoto"

#: js/bioland-help-comments-1-0-21.js
msgid "Any page/content type can have multiple <b>hero banners</b>.  If there is more then one they will be rotated on an hourly basis."
msgstr "Kowane shafi/nau'in abun ciki na iya samun <b>bango na jarumai</b> da yawa. Idan akwai fiye da ɗaya za a juya su a kowace sa'a."

